<title>USA: Stone Street sets $4.00/shr repayment.</title>
<headline>Stone Street sets $4.00/shr repayment.</headline>
<dateline>MOCKSVILLE, N.C. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Street Bancorp Inc on Thursday said it set a one-time $4.00-per-share repayment of capital payable on July 11 to stockholders of record on June 30.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
